/*
  SignalCategoryTree.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0265 · SignalCategoryTree (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SignalCategoryTree` resolves (table "SignalCategoryTree") lives here with its
  web English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The web `SignalCategoryTree` is an anonymous sub-component that passes raw string
  props into the generic `TreeSelect` primitive (web/src/components/forms). The
  first two blocks reproduce those user-facing strings (the search prompt, empty /
  error messages, friendly category labels, and the TreeSelect chrome); the rest
  backs the native-only states (error/retry, stale/offline banners, accessibility)
  the web delegates to its host page.
*/

